; error: 9:24: 'at r' names the region of everything before it, so it comes after the last part, as in 'a + b + c at r'; a part names a region of its own with '@', as in 'x.str()@r', or in parentheses, as in '(x.str() at r)'
task label(n: int, r: region) -> text@r
    <- "#{n}" at r
fi


task main()
    region r
    show(label(1) at r + "x")
fi
